<title>USA: Katz Media unit sets $100 mln debt due '07.</title>
<headline>Katz Media unit sets $100 mln debt due '07.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Katz Media Corp, a unit of Katz Media Group Inc, was priced in the private placement market on Friday, according to lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities.</p>
<p>BORROWER KATZ MEDIA CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.50 PCT  MATURITY 1/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 7/15/1997 LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10.50 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B			  CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PCT AT 109.50</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
